11. The investigation methodology I want you to remember

Don't memorize 50 commands independently.

Remember the questions.

Processes

What's running?

Get-Process
Get-CimInstance -Class Win32_Process

Network

Who's communicating/listening?

Get-NetTCPConnection

Services

What's persistently running in the background?

Get-Service
Get-CimInstance -ClassName Win32_Service

Registry

What interesting configuration/persistence-related entries exist?

Get-ChildItem
Get-ItemProperty

Accounts

Who's on this machine and who has privilege?

Get-LocalUser
Get-LocalGroupMember Administrators

Scheduled Tasks

What's configured to execute automatically/on a trigger?

Get-ScheduledTask
Get-ScheduledTaskInfo
Export-ScheduledTask

Event Logs

What evidence did Windows record?

Get-WinEvent

